  "property_target": "/$defs/dynamic_local_economy/properties/household_provisioning",
  "property_schema": {
    "$ref": "#/$defs/dynamic_household_provisioning"
  },
  "integration_notes": [
    "新增独立module household_provisioning/1与local_economy codec5；原三个选项仍独立判定。",
    "通用动态表ID循环须跳过household_provisioning；另调用check_household_provision(pack,index)。",
    "每个情景取household_ration_authorizations(scenario,index)；仅在原机构义务issuer检查中跳过其完整核准ID，其他旧检查保留。",
    "原schema驱动作者panel生成基础字段控件；不存在玩家对aggregate家庭的控制授权，不添加命令。",
    "required_capabilities延续native_dynamic_world，不改旧全局摘要。"
  ]
}
